, "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le06ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le06ob06re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img05.jpg", "text": "People-Oriented Roles</br></br><ul><li><span class=\"italic\">Coordinators</span> are traditional team leaders in that they lead the team to what they understand to be its goals and objectives. They are excellent listeners for they are able to understand each team member's value. They are calm, good-natured and are often good delegators. They may be manipulative at times insofar as they may delegate too much, greatly reducing their personal responsibility.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img06.jpg", "text": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">Resource investigators</span> can be described as stable, dominant and extroverted. It's noticed that they are often extremely likable upon first meeting. Their responses tend to be positive and passionate, inasmuch as they are prone to dismiss ideas as quickly as they bring them up. They are the member of the team who brings information from the outside world as they understand the importance of using new ideas. As team members, they like pressure situations and are good improvisers. However, they have a tendency to relax a little too much once the pressure is off.", "time": "24000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn11le06ob06re2img07.jpg", "text": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">Team workers</span> can be described as stable, social and low dominance. The team worker is the individual who is most conscious of the needs and concerns of the other team members.\nThey are the most social and communicative members of the team inasmuch as they know a great deal about the personal lives of their fellow team members. Team workers are often popular and humble. They are the rock of the team. If another team member introduces an idea, team workers tend to try to add-on to the idea, rather than demolishing it. They try to help everyone and believe that others should do the same. They don't like personal confrontation insofar as they often try to evade personal disputes whenever possible. Yet, to some, their non-competitiveness and dislike for conflict may make them seem weak.", "time": "56000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "type": "sena"}